raw_sections.benefits:
[Free Skill Training:]{.underline}

-   Training is offered at three levels --- awareness & orientation,
    > basic training, and vocational training.

[Infrastructure Support:]{.underline}

-   Development of artisan villages with electricity, water, roads, and
    > common facilities.

[Marketing Assistance:]{.underline}

-   Support for exhibitions, fairs, permanent haats, and promotion of
    > Uttarakhand-branded craft products.

[Raw Material Support:]{.underline}

-   Establishment of raw material depots like Wool Bank, Wood Bank.

[Recognition & Awards:]{.underline}

-   Awards for outstanding artisans and participation in
    > national/international fairs.

[Exposure Visits:]{.underline}

-   Exposure tours to other states with advanced handicrafts.

